      "text": "We start by observing that each term in the expression can be represented in the form of $[4k+1]^2 - [4k-3]^2$. Recall the difference of squares formula, $a^2 - b^2 = (a+b)(a-b)$.\n\nApplying this formula to each pair of terms, we get:\n\n\\begin{align*}\n19^2 - 17^2 + 15^2 - 13^2 + 11^2 - 9^2 + 7^2 - 5^2 + 3^2 - 1^2 &= (19+17)(19-17) + (15+13)(15-13) + (11+9)(11-9) + (7+5)(7-5) + (3+1)(3-1) - (1+1)(1-1) \\\\\n&= (36)(2) + (28)(2) + (20)(2) + (16)(2) + (4)(2) - (0)(0) \\\\\n&= 72 + 56 + 40 + 32 + 8 - 0 \\\\\n&= 208\n\\end{align*}\n\nTherefore, the value of the given expression is $\\boxed{208}$.",
